1
00:00:12,264 --> 00:00:19,820
J'aurais dû prendre le train de neuf heures. Si j'avais su, j'aurais quitté la maison plus tôt.
I should have taken the nine o'clock train. If I'd known, I would have left home earlier.

2
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:24,836
Moi, j'aurais voulu apprendre le piano quand j'étais petit.
I would have liked to learn the piano when I was little.

3
00:00:24,936 --> 00:00:30,500
Si tu avais commencé à dix ans, tu aurais pu jouer dans un orchestre !
If you had started at ten, you could have played in an orchestra!

4
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:37,460
Peut-être. Mais je n'aurais pas voyagé autant, et je ne t'aurais pas rencontrée.
Maybe. But I wouldn't have travelled as much, and I wouldn't have met you.

5
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,924
Alors je ne regrette rien. Si j'étais restée à Paris, je n'aurais pas eu cette vie.
Then I don't regret anything. If I'd stayed in Paris, I wouldn't have this life.

6
00:00:45,024 --> 00:00:51,332
On dit qu'il vaut mieux avoir des remords que des regrets, mais je préfère ni l'un ni l'autre !
They say it's better to have remorse than regrets, but I prefer neither!
